\newlabel{tab:pattern}{{12}{19}{Missing-pattern MAE on the four datasets at 80\,\% sparsity. \MARST is the lowest-MAE method under point and block patterns on every dataset. Under whole-sensor outage, \KNN is competitive with or beats \MARST because \KNN is the only method whose prediction does not depend on the absent sensor's own history. \LOCF collapses catastrophically: with no observation at all in the evaluation window, the model degrades to a global-mean baseline}{table.caption.22}{}}
