\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {12}{\ignorespaces Per-seed stability strip plot on PEMS08. \textsc  {Marst}\xspace  (left-most) shows tight clustering across three training seeds and five eval-mask seeds; its standard deviation of 0.107 veh/5min is small relative to the comparable transformer baselines on this dataset (BRITS 0.22, iTransformer 0.37, SAITS 3.01). This information is already conveyed by the $\pm $ values in Table~\ref {tab:main-mae}; the strip plot visualises the per-model dispersion.}}{24}{figure.caption.25}\protected@file@percent }
